        <div class="sub-tittle about-section-1-text">We started with a simple idea: to create a non-intrusive way for people to pay using the most readily available medium – text messaging. Our deliberate design allows our technology to disappear in the background, making it easy for businesses to efficiently grow sales and reduce checkout abandonment. We are constantly rethinking commerce and payments, and our goal is to use simple technology to help businesses connect with their customers seamlessly.</div>
